{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extraction Manifest</strong>\u00a0<strong>is a fast-paced top-down 2D loot-and-extract game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The core loop is simple: drop, loot, fight, get out\u2014but we\u2019ve trimmed the fat. No endless rummaging; every crate you crack open is a dopamine hit and every firefight matters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Background \u2013 2045</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A biochemical slug-fest between super-powers wiped out most of humanity. Survivors rebuilt in the wastelands; those left behind learned to leash the infected for short windows and now style themselves \u201cReavers.\u201d Their goal: raid the last enclaves and take what\u2019s yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re one of the operators who still dare to enter the Red Zones, fill the Manifest, and make it back alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Loop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search \u2013 Fight \u2013 Extract</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/beb46bc77805a4b0f5efccb85946949e.poster.avif?t=1758447384\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/beb46bc77805a4b0f5efccb85946949e.webm?t=1758447384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/beb46bc77805a4b0f5efccb85946949e.mp4?t=1758447384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/918f5773e78485bcd6b257f3e688a817.poster.avif?t=1758447384\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/918f5773e78485bcd6b257f3e688a817.webm?t=1758447384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/918f5773e78485bcd6b257f3e688a817.mp4?t=1758447384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/76159c07282224d66ccc822c0fc5e09b.poster.avif?t=1758447384\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/76159c07282224d66ccc822c0fc5e09b.webm?t=1758447384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/76159c07282224d66ccc822c0fc5e09b.mp4?t=1758447384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tetris-style inventory you\u2019ll swear at mid-run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep gun-modding: barrels, receivers, stocks, optics, mags, ammo type\u2014build before you drop or craft on the fly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/128c003227e930ac90ad750d66e7c75d.poster.avif?t=1758447384\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/128c003227e930ac90ad750d66e7c75d.webm?t=1758447384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signature Systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-tap Quick Loot &amp; Instant Contract Turn-in \u2013 grab the objective, slam it into the evac drone, cash hits your account before the chopper lands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/2a745a5f7ad46f61957c70c668a1e8ed.poster.avif?t=1758447384\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/2a745a5f7ad46f61957c70c668a1e8ed.webm?t=1758447384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/2a745a5f7ad46f61957c70c668a1e8ed.mp4?t=1758447384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contracts &amp; Recruitment \u2013 take jobs, rescue/head-hire NPC operatives, expand and upgrade your off-grid base</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/e6490b83568db40afe24183e29544bc5.poster.avif?t=1758447384\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/e6490b83568db40afe24183e29544bc5.webm?t=1758447384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/e6490b83568db40afe24183e29544bc5.mp4?t=1758447384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-weapon Platforms \u2013 strap miniguns to rover dogs, park automated turrets, or pilot a salvaged exo-mech\u2014if you can afford the parts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/b4985d957d37d4e67ff69083a050d64c.poster.avif?t=1758447384\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/b4985d957d37d4e67ff69083a050d64c.webm?t=1758447384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/b4985d957d37d4e67ff69083a050d64c.mp4?t=1758447384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/cecc00d13a8cd8978680251ed84959d5.poster.avif?t=1758447384\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/cecc00d13a8cd8978680251ed84959d5.webm?t=1758447384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/cecc00d13a8cd8978680251ed84959d5.mp4?t=1758447384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop-Zone Selector &amp; On-Call Airdrop \u2013 choose where you enter, then spend coin to summon a mid-match crate (just watch the flare give you away)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/b3e8d24c257908c84f0cdb03dfacea20.poster.avif?t=1758447384\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/b3e8d24c257908c84f0cdb03dfacea20.webm?t=1758447384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022620/extras/b3e8d24c257908c84f